        "install_factor": 1.4
      },
      "currency": "USD", "base_index_name": "CEPCI", "base_index_value": 500, "base_index_year": 2006,
      "bare_module": null, "pressure_model": null,
      "notes": "SSLW cost_distillation_trays. base_per_tray=468*exp(0.1739*D_ft); N_factor=max(1,2.25/1.0414^N); Ftm=a1+a2*D_ft; trays=N*N_factor*type*Ftm*base. Handled by costing.cost_trays (not compute_cost). install_factor 1.4 puts trays on the column bare-module basis."
    }
